<SiteLayout title="About" description="Meet John Peña, a Site Reliability Engineer with 10+ years of experience in automation, cloud infrastructure, and reliable platforms.">
  <div class="content-page">
    <header class="page-header"><Prompt command="cat about.md" /><h1>A little about <span class="accent">me.</span></h1></header>
    <div class="about-intro prose">
      <p>I’m a Site Reliability Engineer with <strong>10+ years of experience</strong> across automation, reliability, security, observability, and cloud infrastructure. I focus on making systems resilient, fast, and easy to operate.</p>
      <p>I started my career at a mid-size company, then joined a startup as its first DevOps Engineer, building the infrastructure and CI/CD pipelines from the ground up. Across these roles and later work at larger companies, my responsibilities have ranged from full-stack operations to deep platform specialization.</p>
      <p>Today I’m at <a href="https://www.udemy.com/">Udemy</a>, focused on reliability at scale and building developer tooling.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="about-section"><h2><span class="heading-hash" aria-hidden="true">#</span> What I do</h2><p class="body-text">I build reliable, observable platforms that teams can ship on with confidence. That includes making deployments safer, reducing incident risk, and automating the repetitive stuff so engineers can move faster.</p>
      <dl class="skills-grid"><div><dt>01 / Reliability</dt><dd>SLOs, incident response, capacity planning</dd></div><div><dt>02 / Platform</dt><dd>Kubernetes, Helm, Skaffold, Terraform, Istio, Argo CD</dd></div><div><dt>03 / Observability</dt><dd>Datadog</dd></div></dl>
    </section>
    <section class="about-section"><h2><span class="heading-hash" aria-hidden="true">#</span> Certifications</h2><ul class="cert-list"><li>AWS Certified Developer <span>Associate</span></li><li>AWS Certified Solutions Architect <span>Associate</span></li><li>Red Hat Certified Systems Administrator <span>RHCSA</span></li><li>Certified Meraki Network Operator</li></ul></section>
    <section class="about-section prose"><h2><span class="heading-hash" aria-hidden="true">#</span> Away from the keyboard</h2><p>I love learning new things. Outside of work I’m into coding side projects, video games, sports, and spending time with my wife, two kids, and two French bulldogs.</p><p>Favorite shows: Mr. Robot, Silicon Valley, and Community. You can follow me on <a href="https://twitter.com/jpena23">Twitter</a>.</p></section>
